ons","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Install matching client and server versions and start a local server with one fixed map.","Record server settings and disable uncontrolled changes between trials.","Use demos or a custom harness to preserve inputs and detect finish or reset events.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Complete a fixed map section using movement, jump and hook inputs.","Modify a physics or collision rule and compare recorded runs.","Test two cooperating clients and measure synchronization, completion and failed interactions.","AI use and evaluation boundary","The client/server source enables instrumentation. Preserve map authorship and data licenses when sharing fixtures or replays; conduct repeatable tests on a local server.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Code, data and third-party licenses","https://github.com/ddnet/ddnet/blob/master/license.txt","Steam release","https://store.steampowered.com/app/412220/DDraceNetwork/","Official source and local server instructions","https://github.com/ddnet/ddnet","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":94},"Terms category","Mixed code / asset licenses","terms","provenance","Asset license","Game data defaults to CC BY-SA 3.0; fonts and other files have exceptions recorded in license.txt.","assetLicense","Code license","zlib for project code, with bundled third-party licenses.","codeLicense","Get started",[116],"access",{"_54":117,"_25":96,"_118":119},"Free Steam game","note","Free game and local server binaries. Use a private local server for controlled evaluation.","Primary source",[123],"sourceUrl",{"_54":120,"_25":98},"Stack","C++ / CMake / networked precision platformer","stack","Tracks",[130],"dimensions","2D","Testing goals",[134,135],"uses","Coding & automated playtests","Vision, control & planning","Resource kind","Games & engine projects","lead","s